    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but i cant really call my doctor right now, they're closed until monday and i'm feeling miserable. is it really that dangerous though? like, just a single dose of the regular sudafed shouldn't mess anything up too badly, right? i just need to breathe.",
